{"root":"tonjol","ipa":"/ton.dʒol/","core":"指突出、显露或强调某事物，常用于描述物理上的凸起或抽象意义上的突出表现。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ton.dʒol/","zh":"突出，显露","phrases":[{"t":"tonjol diri","zh":"自我表现，出风头"},{"t":"menonjolkan bakat","zh":"展现才华"},{"t":"tonjolan tulang","zh":"骨骼突出处"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia selalu ingin menonjol dalam setiap pertemuan.","zh":"他总是想在每次会议中表现突出。"},{"t":"Paku itu menonjol dari permukaan kayu.","zh":"那根钉子从木头表面凸了出来。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"tonjol","ipa":"/ton.dʒol/","zh":"突出物，凸起部分","phrase":{"t":"tonjol tanah","zh":"土丘，凸起的地面"},"example":{"t":"Ada tonjol kecil di dinding itu.","zh":"那面墙上有一个小凸起。"}},{"w":"menonjol","ipa":"/mə.non.dʒol/","zh":"突出的，显著的","phrase":{"t":"perbedaan yang menonjol","zh":"显著的区别"},"example":{"t":"Prestasi siswa itu sangat menonjol di kelas.","zh":"那个学生的成绩在班里非常突出。"}},{"w":"menonjolkan","ipa":"/mə.non.dʒol.kan/","zh":"使突出，强调，凸显","phrase":{"t":"menonjolkan kelebihan","zh":"强调优点"},"example":{"t":"Iklan ini menonjolkan kualitas produk.","zh":"这则广告突出了产品的质量。"}},{"w":"tonjolan","ipa":"/ton.dʒo.lan/","zh":"凸起，突起物","phrase":{"t":"tonjolan batu","zh":"岩石的凸起处"},"example":{"t":"Dia tersandung tonjolan akar pohon.","zh":"他被树根的凸起处绊倒了。"}}],"derSlugs":["tonjol","menonjol","menonjolkan","tonjolan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-30T15:46:54.775Z","src":"base"}